		{
			dependencies: ["534D440D27B71DE0"]
			id: "38D63631177C510F"
			rewards: [
				{
					command: "/give @s written_book{title:\"a Dark Story\",author:\"You\",pages:['{\"text\":\"I remember a time when magic bathed our world, when every day was a living miracle. I grew up in Elysia, a city of crystal and light, where enchanters healed illnesses with simple whispers and erected towers that defied the heavens\"}','{\"text\":\"My mentor, Maëlys, taught me the art of magic. Every morning, I watched her transform crops into bounty, making the fields blossom beneath her fingers. Our streets vibrated with life and laughter, a world shaped by enchantment.\"}','{\"text\":\"One day, Maëlys told me of the existence of a Desolate Dimension, a sort of projection of our world without magic or life. She said that this world was empty, colorless, but that it could contain dark energy, far more obscure than black magic.\"}','{\"text\":\"Several expeditions were launched by the greatest magicians of the time, but none returned. From what Maëlys said: rumors cited the use of a Shard at the very bottom of the Cavum Tenebrae dimension.\"}','{\"text\":\"This story has had a profound effect on me. It taught me to cherish the magic that surrounded us, to see it as a precious gift, not an acquired right\"}','{\"text\":\"Today, when magic is no longer in my world, I keep these memories alive, hoping that one day, enchantments will be reborn for good.\"}']}"
					icon: "computercraft:printed_book"
					id: "07D40C508E718E2F"
					player_command: true
					title: "一个黑暗的故事"
					type: "command"
				}
				{
